  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "Utkarsh Rhodium Credit Card comes in both secured and unsecured variants backed by an FD amount of Rs. 25,000. The credit card offers basic cashback, travel, and fuel-related benefits. It offers 1.25% cashback on other eligible spends. Cardholders can also get up to 4 domestic airport lounge visits in a calendar year. For international usage, the card has a 3% foreign currency markup fee. On fuel purchases between Rs. 400 and Rs. 5,000, the card gives a 1% fuel surcharge waiver, with a maximum benefit of Rs. 400. The annual fee is Rs. 4,999 plus taxes, and it can be waived if the cardholder spends at least Rs. 5 Lakh in a card anniversary year. Overall, the card does not have much to offer, making it a suitable option for the cardholders who want to avail a basic credit card to start their credit journey.",
